  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I added an avatar to VRC+ Group 1, and while it updated the favorites list both in the quick menu wing (left side) and the main avatar menu immediately, after restarting the game, the avatar that was added to said category disappears from the quick menu wing, although it's still shows as favorited on the main avatar menu. This only happens on VRC+ Group 1 and 2, and doesn't happen on the main Favorites list as well as VRC+ Group 3.\n\nReplication steps:\nAdd an avatar to either VRC+ Group 1 or VRC+ Group 2, then restart the game. It will be missing from said category on the avatar wing on the quick menu.",
